WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.400
Episode 17

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.400
Charge<i>!! 
</i>  Paranodon Attack Squadron<i>!</i>

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.400
( Air date: Jan 26, 1975 )

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.200
Saraba Chikyuu yo

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.000
Tabidatsu fune wa...

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:42.150
...uchuu senkan Yamato

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.150
Space Battleship

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.150
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.600
Uchuu no kanata Iscandar he...

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.650
...unmei seoi...

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.010
...ima tobitatsu

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.530
Kanarazu koko he...

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:56.400
...kaette kuru to

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:02.320
Te wo furu hito ni...

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:05.200
...egao de kotae

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.690
Ginga wo hanare...

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:08.800
...Iscandar he...

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:12.000
...harubaru nozomu

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:18.700
Uchuu senkan Yamato

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:43.590
In 2199, Earth was attacked by Meteor
Bombs from the mysterious planet Gamilus...

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:48.020
{SONO}...and mankind was facing extinction in one
year due to the radioactive contamination.

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:03.820
{CHIKYUU}The space battleship Yamato, the first
Earth ship to exceed the speed of light...

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:07.220
{CHIKYUU}...has left for Iscandar to
obtain the radioactive purifier.

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:14.770
Galactic System

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:17.570
Iscandar is 148,000 light years away in the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:18.820
Large Magellanic Cloud

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:22.670
{GENZAI}Their current destination is
the mid point, planet Balan.

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:25.620
{YAMATO}Balan appears to be a beacon
in space for the Yamato...

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:29.320
{YAMATO}...but it's also a Gamilus supply
base for the invasion of Earth.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:31.770
Planet Balan

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:34.370
{Domel}After being assigned as commander of
the Solar System region operations...

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:39.570
{Domel}...a famed admiral, Domel, has just
arrived on planet Balan with his fleet.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:42.620
{BALAN}Using Balan as
his main base...

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:46.580
{BALAN}...Admiral Domel is like a space wolf
sharpening its fangs to kill the Yamato.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.320
Admiral Domel

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.220
The Yamato is 16 days
away from planet Balan.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:24.450
Chief Navigator,
the course is correct.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.920
Okay.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:29.090
I'm glad it's been peaceful
for the last few days.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:32.860
Warps were performed as planned, and we
should be able to make up for the delay.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:34.570
No, not yet.

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:38.590
According to the plan, we should've only
spent 10 days leaving the Solar System.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:41.570
And 10 more days for
the Galactic System.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:45.670
Forty-five days
to reach Balan.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:50.940
And we have forty-five
days to get to Iscandar.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:54.020
But the Yamato
is still here.

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:58.920
We should have spent sixty-five
days from Earth to Balan...

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:02.610
{MOU}...but we've already
spent ninety-eight days.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:07.080
I hope we can recover the time
loss before we get to Balan.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:18.130
Planet Balan

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:18.360
The Yamato's current destination, Balan,
is a dark planet, 77,000 light years from Earth.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.620
There's no sun or moon
to light its surface.

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:26.920
{AKARI}The only light sources are volcanoes, and
the countless number of stars in dark space.

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:34.520
{CHIHYOU}Rapidly growing plants, which are similar
to deep-sea plants, grow on the surface.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.790
{OOKISA}Its size is
20 times Earth's.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:43.670
Balan Frontline Base

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:42.430
{SHIKASHI}Its rotation is very fast, but gravity
near the equator is very weak...

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:47.110
{NINGEN}...and it's very comfortable
for humanoid type creatures.

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:52.530
{KONO}Domel's Solar System invasion
base is located near the equator.

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:57.120
Soon they will form my desired
shape of a Paranodon.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:02.170
The head part is missing.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:07.500
Perhaps my envisioning ability
is not strong enough.

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.850
Let's try
again tomorrow.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:09.370
Aye, sir.

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:26.980
Commander Domel, the Paranodon
attack squadron is almost complete.

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:28.810
Good work, Gale.

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:33.310
This extraordinary plan will
surely defeat the Yamato.

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:39.600
But it was so hard to train such
a gentle creature like the Paranodon.

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:41.680
Gale, let's begin
the mission briefing.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:42.990
Commander Domel...?!

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:47.220
Lord Desler's plan is for
Gamilus to colonize Earth.

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:51.460
The space battleship Yamato
has greatly delayed our plans.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:58.410
I've ordered the Pluto base reconstruction
project team to plan that matter.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:03.370
While we're doing that,
we must also destroy the Yamato.

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:05.370
That's why,
Commander Domel...

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:10.950
I'll use the Paranodon attack squadron
to turn the Yamato into space dust.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:14.570
That Yamato, if they take
this Balan base lightly...

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:18.540
...just because they were able to destroy
the Pluto base, they'll be in trouble.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:23.210
Gale, calm down.  They
shouldn't have noticed us yet.

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.520
They must be heading for Balan
as a half way mark to Iscandar.

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:31.620
They don't even think
we have a base here.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:36.140
We'll take advantage of their
carelessness and destroy them in one attack.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.900
Hold off until then.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:41.980
Commander Domel, is it
alright to be so cautious ?

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.770
His passive way of fighting...

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:47.370
...was the reason Shultz lost
the Pluto Frontline Base...

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:50.320
...an important milestone in
our colonization of Earth.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.600
Gale...

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.760
Please reconsider,
Commander Domel !

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:56.170
If we attack the Yamato as much
as possible while it's still far away...

00:07:56.170 --> 00:08:01.920
...wouldn't we be being more
faithful to Lord Desler ?

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:06.480
{SONOTAME}That's what my precious Paranodon
attack squadrons are for.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:07.570
Stop, Gale.

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:12.170
I'm the commander
of this base.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:33.770
The warp is over.
I'm switching to automatic pilot.

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:37.120
We can relax for a while.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.060
Captain !

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:42.720
Captain.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.920
Because of the
continuous warp...

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.370
It must've put a lot
of stress on him.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:00.290
Kodai, what happened
to the Captain ?

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:01.500
He collapsed.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.620
Collapsed ?

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:08.320
Captain...

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.390
It's alright now.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:19.050
Okay.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.070
Captain.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.170
It's progressed a lot.

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:33.980
I'm sorry to
tell you this...

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:36.590
...but an operation has to
be done, or you'll die.

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:40.420
I can't give you a 100% guarantee of
survival even after the operation is done.

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:41.470
I see.

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:50.370
Even if the chance falls to only 1%,
please perform the operation...

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:53.880
...and let me perform my
duty a little longer.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:55.410
A man is
asking a favor.

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:02.220
I'm a man, too.

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:04.390
Mori, prepare for
an operation.  Hurry.

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:05.040
Okay.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:10.670
Doctor, if something happens,
there's a note on my desk...

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.610
...which details how to
proceed with our journey.

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:18.900
I got it, but I won't let you die.
You can't die so easily.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.880
Analyzer, please help.

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:26.670
Okay.

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:38.820
Anesthesia, okay.  Oxygen
inhaler, okay.  All, okay.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:40.390
Laser scalpel.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:40.920
Here.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.970
Blood pressure is falling,
and breathing is abnormal.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.170
Camphor.

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.370
Captain...

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.850
Who do you think I am ?!

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:45.330
I'm asking you !
Who am I ?!

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.620
Vice Commander Gale, sir.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.050
How dare you...!

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:55.770
You called me Commander,
Commander, until a while ago !

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.620
And while your words are
fresh from your mouth...

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:01.750
{YOKUMO}How could you call
me Vice Commander ?

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:03.420
Say something !

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.740
Yamato detected.

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:30.470
Bearing FZ3, minus 6.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.470
Good, launch Paranodons.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:48.610
Alright, go.

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:56.910
Paranodon formation.

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:10.470
They did it.

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:31.090
Combine Paranodons.

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:47.150
Go, destroy the Yamato.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:15.720
The attack on the dummy
Yamato was successful.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:19.240
The real Yamato will
meet the same fate.

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:23.570
That Domel doesn't want me to be
successful, but that won't happen.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.320
Commander Domel.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:33.580
What's the matter so
early in the morning ?

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:36.270
Vice Commander Gale has left,
leading the special attack squadron.

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:41.310
That idiot.
He still doesn't understand.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:56.320
I did everything I could,
but I don't know.

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:57.320
What do you mean ?

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:03.570
The operation was successful, but we have
to wait for a few hours to know the result.

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:10.370
Captain, please survive.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.410
Approaching the Yamato.
Distance, 12,000.

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:58.600
Prepare to
launch Paranodons.

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:00.600
Prepare to launch Paranodons.

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:04.650
Prepare yourself, Yamato.
Your life is about to end.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.790
An object detected on radar
is approaching rapidly.

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:15.320
Bearing, 10 degrees left,
relative speed, 6000 space knots.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.410
Switching to
the video panel.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.160
That's Gamilus.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:24.100
Damn Gamilus, while
the Captain is absent...

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:25.710
All hands, battlestations !

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:28.630
Wait, Kodai.  Shouldn't we
run in a situation like this ?

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:30.220
No way.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:33.180
Because the situation is like this, we have to
get rid of the obstacle as soon as possible.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.920
What's the fuss ?

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:36.100
Quiet.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:38.570
Gamilus ships
are approaching.

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:42.450
But the Captain is absent.
We can't move without his approval.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:46.170
What should we do ?
The Gamilus ships are still closing in.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:50.770
Launch Paranodons.

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:07.820
What the...?

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.280
What's that ?

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:13.840
Is that a
space creature ?

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.570
We're out of time !
What should we do ?!

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:26.770
Prepare to fire
the shock cannons !

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:27.910
Kodai.

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:28.520
Kodai.

00:17:31.390 --> 00:17:33.360
Shock cannons are
ready to fire.

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:40.170
Correction, left 2 degrees,
relative velocity plus 3.

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:44.950
Charge !
Destroy it !

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.920
It's in range of
the shock cannons.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:55.570
Firing.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:11.370
I did it.

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:21.040
What's that stuff ?

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:40.700
It returned to its original form.
The attack didn't work.

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:45.250
Even if I hit, they break
apart and reform into one piece.

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:50.270
If they crash into the Yamato,
we don't know what will happen.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:01.370
It's back
in one piece.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.370
It's bigger
than the Yamato.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:05.410
What do we do ?
Run away ?

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.560
Too late.

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:11.370
We have to use
the Wave Motion Gun.

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:15.560
But we just warped.  For the
safety of the ship, that's...

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:19.440
Even if it might stress the ship,
we have to get out of this situation.

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:22.700
I'll take responsibility,
so please let me do it.

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:24.500
Alright, let's do it.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.060
Let's do it, Kodai.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:29.110
Alright, let the Wave
Motion Gun decide our fate.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.700
Energy charge, plus 100.
Energy valve, closed.

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:39.570
Energy charge, plus 200.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:40.720
Safety lock, off.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.920
Fifteen seconds to firing.
Prepare for flash and shock.

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:50.780
Reticle adjustment,
right 3 degrees.

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:52.340
Alright, it's in the
reticle.  Dead ahead.

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:04.390
Fire.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:38.310
Wave Motion Gun...

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:40.220
The Wave Motion Gun did it ?

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:43.370
Dammit. Dammit.
Dammit. Dammit.

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:51.160
Chief Engineer, outer panels
were damaged again.

00:20:55.920 --> 00:21:00.240
It was right after the warp, so the shock
of the Wave Motion Gun must have done it.

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:18.780
He survived.
The Captain survived.

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:22.370
He survived.
The Captain survived.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:24.600
He survived.
The Captain survived.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:37.860
Everyone, well done.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:43.070
Captain, I'm sorry. I damaged the ship
because of my unauthorized decision.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:47.240
Kodai, I thank you for managing the
ship and overcoming the obstacles.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:52.700
They say lions throw their babies
into a bottomless ravine for a trial...

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:57.040
...and you're the baby lion who
climbed up from the ravine, Kodai.

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.420
Injuries are to be expected.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:03.760
An injured body can
be healed.  Thank you.

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:11.130
Captain, you have
to get some sleep.

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:44.520
Defeated by the
Wave Motion Gun ?

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:47.370
Idiot.  That was expected
in the first place.

00:22:47.370 --> 00:22:50.370
{OUSEN}Just because it could destroy
an unarmed dummy Yamato...

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:53.200
{OUSEN}...doesn't mean it could
be useful in real combat.

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:54.480
How foolish of you.

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:19.510
The Yamato is hurrying to Balan,
the mid point between Earth and Iscandar.

00:23:19.510 --> 00:23:23.370
But Admiral Domel is waiting there.

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:27.340
Try hard, Yamato.
Earth is waiting for you.

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:31.700
Only 263 days left
until extinction.

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:33.700
Only 263 days remain.

00:23:33.170 --> 00:23:38.770
263 days left until the destruction of Earth

00:23:42.420 --> 00:23:47.600
Okita Juzo:

00:23:42.420 --> 00:23:47.600
Naya Goro

00:23:46.270 --> 00:23:54.870
Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf

00:23:47.880 --> 00:23:53.100
Mori Yuki:

00:23:47.880 --> 00:23:53.100
Asagami Yoko

00:23:53.390 --> 00:23:58.610
Domel:

00:23:53.390 --> 00:23:58.610
Kobayashi Osamu

00:23:54.870 --> 00:24:03.670
Dareno tame da to omotte iruka

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:08.430
Note:
Gale gets drunk and goes mad in his quarters.
The scared women wore only pink underwear, under their coats.

00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:11.970
Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka

00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:18.430
Note:
The Gamilus tandem airplane, used to control the Paranodons, was originally designed to spin during flight.

00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:18.430
According to monster movie freaks, the voice of Paranodon sounds like Hedra of "Godzilla vs Hedra."

00:24:11.970 --> 00:24:20.870
Minna sono ki de ireba ii

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:26.430
Note:
Okita didn't take off his hat during
the operation.

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:26.430
It took place on the 98th day. Yamato is 16 days away from Balan, 77,000 light years away from Earth. The scene, where the Yamato defeated the Paranodon, was the 100th day. Earth will be destroyed in 263 days.

00:24:20.870 --> 00:24:29.270
Tabidattsu otoko no mune ni wa

00:24:26.960 --> 00:24:31.560
Translation

00:24:26.960 --> 00:24:31.560
Editing

00:24:29.270 --> 00:24:36.870
Roman no kakera ga hoshii no sa

00:24:31.560 --> 00:24:39.130
Timing

00:24:31.560 --> 00:24:39.130
Song Translations

00:24:36.870 --> 00:24:40.870
La la la...

00:24:39.130 --> 00:24:47.130
A

00:24:40.870 --> 00:24:44.870
La la la...

00:24:44.870 --> 00:24:54.770
La la la, makka na scarf
